  "classification": {
    "rootCause": "code-bug",
    "summary": "UniV3Wrapper.getUnclaimedFees() ran its _limitFees() cap only against combined two-token fee growth, so fees generated in a single token by attacker-driven swaps in the USDC/USDC.e pool were added in full to getAssetsBasedOnPrice(), inflating the wrapper LP price read by the lending market's WrapperOracle and allowing an over-borrow."
  },
